From 97c5a4992602ba3317bfc9753a0db30db5d3672c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 19:44:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] Give Sabi its own visual identity instead of the
 cream-and-serif look

Danfo yellow, ink and Lagos green replace the ivory/gold palette; Bricolage
Grotesque and Instrument Sans replace Cormorant and Lexend; a voice-bar mark
replaces the spark. Legacy token names are remapped so pricing and developer
pages pick up the new system unchanged.
